ts\/26125","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089386"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=26125"}],"version-history":[{"count":9,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/26125\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":26149,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/26125\/revisions\/26149"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/26133"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=26125"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=26125"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=26125"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=26125"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":26139,"date":"2024-10-10T08:56:52","date_gmt":"2024-10-10T12:56:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=26139"},"modified":"2024-10-11T17:56:33","modified_gmt":"2024-10-11T21:56:33","slug":"forbes-1-ranked","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/forbes-1-ranked","title":{"rendered":"Kraken is Forbes\u2019 #1-ranked crypto exchange"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are proud to announce Kraken has been named the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.forbes.com\/advisor\/investing\/cryptocurrency\/best-crypto-exchanges\/\">#1 crypto exchange by Forbes<\/a>, solidifying our position as a leader in the cryptocurrency market. This recognition is a testament to Kraken&#8217;s commitment to providing a secure, reliable and client-friendly platform for buying, selling and trading digital assets.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So, what sets Kraken apart from its competitors? According to Forbes, several key factors contributed to Kraken&#8217;s top ranking. Here are a few reasons why Kraken stands out:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Security<\/strong>: Kraken&#8217;s robust security measures, including two-factor authentication, SSL encryption and a bug bounty program, provide users with peace of mind when it comes to protecting their assets.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Low fees<\/strong>: Kraken offers competitive fees, making it an attractive option for traders of all levels. With fees <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/features\/fee-schedule\">as low as 0% for makers and 0.10% for takers<\/a> (and even up to a -.0060 <strong>rebate <\/strong>for futures trades), Kraken is an excellent choice for those looking to minimize their trading costs.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Wide range of assets<\/strong>: With <a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360000678446-Cryptocurrencies-available-on-Kraken\">over 220 listed assets<\/a>, Kraken offers an extensive selection of cryptocurrencies, including popular coins like Bitcoin and Ethereum, as well as lesser-known altcoins.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>User-friendly interface<\/strong>: Kraken&#8217;s intuitive interface makes it easy for clients to navigate the platform, even for those new to cryptocurrency trading.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Regulatory compliance<\/strong>: Kraken is committed to regulatory compliance, with licenses and registrations in multiple jurisdictions, providing clients with an added layer of confidence in the platform&#8217;s legitimacy.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In addition to these factors, Kraken&#8217;s commitment to innovation and client support also contributed to its top ranking. With a dedicated team of experts available 24\/7\/365 to assist with any questions or concerns, Kraken provides a level of support that is unmatched in the industry.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Kraken\u2019s #1 crypto exchange ranking by Forbes reflects the quality and reliability born of our client-obsessed culture. Join our community today and experience the benefits of trading with a top-ranked crypto exchange.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/sign-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get started with Kraken<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>These materials are for general information purposes only and are not investment advice or a recommendation or solicitation to buy, sell, stake, or hold any cryptoasset or to engage in any specific trading strategy. Kraken makes no representation or warranty of any kind, express or implied, as to the accuracy, completeness, timeliness, suitability or validity of any such information and will not be liable for any errors, omissions, or delays in this information or any losses, injuries, or damages arising from its display or use. Kraken does not and will not work to increase or decrease the price of any particular cryptoasset it makes available. Some crypto products and markets are unregulated, and you may not be protected by government compensation and\/or regulatory protection schemes. The unpredictable nature of the cryptoasset markets can lead to loss of funds. Tax may be payable on any return and\/or on any increase in the value of your cryptoassets and you should seek independent advice on your taxation position. Not available in the US and other geographic restrictions apply. Reward rates are subject to change, please refer to Kraken\u2019s&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/legal\">Terms of Service<\/a>&nbsp;for additional information.&nbsp;<\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We are proud to announce Kraken has been named the #1 crypto exchange by Forbes, solidifying our position as a leader in the cryptocurrency market. This recognition is a testament to Kraken&#8217;s commitment to providing a secure, reliable and client-friendly platform for buying, selling and trading digital assets. So, what sets Kraken apart from its [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":26142,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1783],"tags":[1373,1403],"language":[],"class_list":["post-26139","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-industry-news","tag-featured","tag-kraken"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Kraken is Forbes\u2019 #1-ranked crypto exchange - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/forbes-1-ranked\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta pr